  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy favors random_walk in clear conditions, inserts short forward pulses for coverage, and uses one-shot obstacle recovery states with conservative backward/turn actions. Uncontrollable events are total in every specification state, and action states self-loop on path_clear so intended pulses are not preempted.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensor outcomes from motion capability in G for concise synthesis-friendly composition",
    "Use one policy automaton for clear exploration alternation and three small recovery automata for front/left/right obstacle handling"
